            "part": 2,
            "nparts": 3,
            "line": 11,
            "snippet": "\nTable 1: Maximum path lengths, per-layer complexity and minimum number of sequential operations for different layer types. n is the sequence length, d is the representation dimension, k is the kernel size of convolutions and r the size of the neighborhood in restricted self-attention.",
            "overridden_by": [],
